  "title": "Israeli settlers escalate attacks on Palestinian communities in the West Bank",
  "summary": "Israeli settlers set fire to Palestinian homes and vehicles in villages near Nablus, while Palestinians claim the attacks are part of a broader conflict in the West Bank. Four Palestinians and one Israeli settler were killed in a shooting in the northern West Bank, according to health officials. A senior officer in the Hamas-run police force was among those killed in the strike, which Israel's military says targeted 'terrorists.'",
